00:18:37,280 --> 00:18:41,340
And I happen to excel at spreading such information.

281
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:46,560
We have acquired Brew, the most powerful tool created by the Great Wizard.

282
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:49,740
We are armed with a threat and our enemy's fear.

283
00:19:03,340 --> 00:19:04,340
Well done.

284
00:19:04,860 --> 00:19:05,800
Now, where is it?

285
00:19:06,220 --> 00:19:06,860
Right here.

286
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:08,980
This is the real version of Brew.

287
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:13,900
Arachne, what a silly little fool.

288
00:19:14,780 --> 00:19:19,440
She caused that explosion all those centuries ago to keep Brew's existence hidden from the Reaper.

289
00:19:20,740 --> 00:19:22,480
Your spies did very well, Erika.

290
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:25,260
Thanks to them, we knew it had survived the blast.

291
00:19:26,060 --> 00:19:29,700
Arachne didn't think to plant any surveillance spiders in the magnetic field.

292
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:36,720
That made it a simple enough task for us to swipe the real Brew and leave behind the useless fake we had created to use as a decoy.

293
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:42,360
And Arachne will have no idea the magic tool in her possession isn't even the real thing.

294
00:19:43,080 --> 00:19:45,280
The problem now is the DWMA, right?

295
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:47,440
How do we keep them out of the way?

296
00:19:48,380 --> 00:19:51,260
I still have Krona spying on them for me.

297
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:52,400
Have you forgotten?

298
00:19:53,040 --> 00:19:54,980
You helped him plant that bug, right?

299
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:57,780
No, of course I remember!

300
00:19:57,780 --> 00:20:01,980
Krona and I planted that snake inside Professor Stein's partner.

301
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:10,120
You understand that that little snake is more than just a way of listening in on their conversations, don't you?

302
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:11,500
Kinda.

303
00:20:12,860 --> 00:20:16,840
That snake was implanted with a magic designed to speed up his madness.

304
00:20:16,840 --> 00:20:21,160
It's not my best work, but it should be enough.

305
00:20:21,540 --> 00:20:24,280
Stein's mental state isn't the most stable to begin with.

306
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:28,520
But it's a balancing act.

307
00:20:28,900 --> 00:20:32,360
We don't want his madness to reach its peak too soon or too late.

308
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:38,640
The Reaper places great faith in Stein.

309
00:20:39,100 --> 00:20:41,080
He'll be sent to the forefront of the battle.

310
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:46,380
While fighting, Stein will naturally have to resonate with his partner.

311
00:20:46,840 --> 00:20:54,640
And when he does, the snake's magic will hit him all at once.

312
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:59,620
She knew there was going to be a struggle of R'Groo before she placed that snake.

313
00:21:00,200 --> 00:21:04,480
She's controlling this huge fight between the two sides with one tiny reptile?

314
00:21:07,980 --> 00:21:10,160
R'Groo, the Tempest.

315
00:21:10,780 --> 00:21:14,840
Only someone who knows how to create a truly great storm deserves it.

316
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:23,160
This is just the beginning for the Academy and Arachnophobia.

317
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:25,100
And you,

318
00:21:25,660 --> 00:21:26,720
Kishin.

319
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:35,540
R'Groo, the Tempest.

320
00:21:35,540 --> 00:21:36,040
R'Qu Sword

321
00:21:36,040 --> 00:21:56,300
R'Groo, the Tempest.

322
00:21:56,300 --> 00:22:26,280
Thank you.

323
00:22:26,300 --> 00:22:56,280
Thank you.

324
00:22:56,300 --> 00:22:58,300
Thank you.

325
00:23:26,300 --> 00:23:33,200
On the next episode of Soul Eater, the detective's first case, Kid exposes the DWMA's secret?

326
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,080
Symmetry is perfection.

